%% hNFT Gate 0.2 / ADR-0001 (PROPOSED; NOT APPROVED)
%% Only seller-authored Finalization changes NFT ownership.
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Owned: Mint or prior finalized state
    Owned --> Offered: Seller creates Offer
    Offered --> Accepted: Buyer accepts (provisional)
    Accepted --> Finalized: Seller finalizes (title moves)
    Finalized --> Owned: New owner gets finalized state
    Offered --> Cancelled: Seller cancels by accept_by
    Accepted --> Cancelled: Seller cancels; acceptance orphaned
    Offered --> Expired: Seller expires after finalize_by
    Accepted --> Expired: Seller expires; acceptance orphaned
    Cancelled --> Owned: Original owner retained
    Expired --> Owned: Original owner retained
    note right of Accepted
        Acceptance does not grant ownership.
        Remote acceptance can race with seller closure.
    end note
    note right of Finalized
        Finalization is exclusive with cancellation or expiry
        on the seller source chain for this ownership state.
    end note
